    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751980/extras/852be0627e643e476c5625d7ed7a2f2c.avif?t=1742659663\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Savior From Above is a sidescrolling 3D adventure shortgame that combines multiple genres and features various action and puzzle sequences. Its artistic approach is supported by powerful visuals, intense atmosphere and a unique game narrative on the boundaries of science-fiction and fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unnamed astronaut crashes his space capsule on an alien planet. As he explores the strange surroundings, he soon discovers that his arrival may not have been entirely accidental. According to the remains of an ancient local culture, he is believed to play a significant role in their history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Savior From Above is a one-man project, a bitesize piece of handcrafted game art, the first release from its creator. The game is 100% free, but any financial support is highly appreciated. Please see the DLCs for donation options. Thank you and safe journeys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751980/extras/852be0627e643e476c5625d7ed7a2f2c.avif?t=1742659663\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Savior From Above is a sidescrolling 3D adventure shortgame that combines multiple genres and features various action and puzzle sequences. Its artistic approach is supported by powerful visuals, intense atmosphere and a unique game narrative on the boundaries of science-fiction and fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unnamed astronaut crashes his space capsule on an alien planet. As he explores the strange surroundings, he soon discovers that his arrival may not have been entirely accidental. According to the remains of an ancient local culture, he is believed to play a significant role in their history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Savior From Above is a one-man project, a bitesize piece of handcrafted game art, the first release from its creator. The game is 100% free, but any financial support is highly appreciated. Please see the DLCs for donation options. Thank you and safe journeys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
